# Type constructor application: Dict/Record type assertion
# [@[a: Int] ...] performs a structural record type check at compile time.
# Map[K V] type constructor is resolved by the annotation system (see ctor_app_seq
# for the Seq[T] case). A Map-typed TypeAssert requires a value already typed as
# Map[K V]; for now we test with a record type that matches the literal value.
[@[a: Int] [a: 1]]
=== out
Dict({"a": Int(1)})
